  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機程式",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER PROGRAMMING",
    "describe_ch": "這門課程的主要目的在於使學生具備基本的Python程式撰寫能力，同時鼓勵學生使用程式語言作為學習的輔助工具。學生將於本課程學習到的概念有宣告、輸入/輸出、迴圈、邏輯條件式、函數及檔案處理等相關內容，並搭配Anaconda編輯器使用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is to develop basic Python programming skill of students, and encourage them to make programming language a supplementary tool for learning. Students in the course will know the basic concept and skill of programming language, such as declaration, input/output, loop structure, conditional structure, function and file operations. Moreover, this course uses Anaconda IDEs, including Spyder and Jupyter.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
